  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception as separate automata, with all motion commands as controllable and all obstacle/corridor sensor events as uncontrollable. The specification enforces safe, conservative exploration: random_walk is preferred in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and recovery from obstacles is always via a single, directed turn or, as a last resort, a full scan. No state reached by an obstacle event enables forward or random_walk. Recovery states are one-shot and always return to exploration. All uncontrollables are total in every state.",
